CORS support
Direct link to CORS support
{
  handler: async (c, next) => {
    c.header('Access-Control-Allow-Origin', '*');
    c.header(
      'Access-Control-Allow-Methods',
      'GET, POST, PUT, DELETE, OPTIONS',
