This example uses the openai model. Add both OPENAI_API_KEY and UNSPLASH_ACCESS_KEY to your .env file.

.env
OPENAI_API_KEY=<your-api-key>
UNSPLASH_ACCESS_KEY=<your-unsplash-access-key>

